  "general_recipe": [
    "Start a=b=H for any finite H>0.",
    "While I=2a+b>=1, let a_next=max(0,I-2H-1), b_next=min(H,I-1). Weighted mass drops at least1; stop after at most floor(3H) stages.",
    "For I>=2H+1 the upper carry is immediately stationary; otherwise delta=2H-I+1>0, and ceil(H/delta)+4 steps suffice.",
    "At terminal I<1 choose dry packet L=floor(3H/(1-I))+1. Let burn dominate every local burn and L.",
    "Choose p=number_of_stages+4, q=4*burn+8 in the complete original H_(p,q). The same nested interior proof forces an unpaid original U RR."
  ],
